    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d638">

                <pb facs="1471" n="1433" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v04/pg1433"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source"> Cabot files, lot 56 D 13, “Panama”</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador John J. Muccio of the United States
                        Negotiating Team to the Assistant Secretary of State for Inter-American
                        Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1954-03-05">March 5, 1954</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Jack</hi>: Kupp and I have sat here the last
                    couple of days doing a bit of “self-criticism”. Result attached.</p>
                <pb facs="1472" n="1434" xml:id="pg1434"/>
                <p>We have gone a substantial distance toward meeting Panamanian aspirations. Panama
                    will never be contented. We can hope only to have them satisfied for the time
                    being. I feel very definitely that if we can avoid being <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >used</hi> by individual Panamanian politicians and can make progress in
                    solving the pending main problems we will be able to bring these negotiations to
                    a reasonably successful conclusion.</p>
                <p>I hope to see Roderick and the Governor again soon, using this memorandum as a
                    basis for further discussion of our remaining problems.</p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <p>All the best to you</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">John</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d638-a1.xml" xpointer="d638-a1"/>
            </div>
